      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omundu oyo aambukula aambila khu luuya lwe enje mala aandangirira aambila mu liombakho liliaba elubeka we bunaswa we Lukaangu; se aaba aleeyi khukhwama khu mombakho ke lubeka lwe mumbo we Lukaangu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liliombakho lino liaba buleeyi chimita kamakhumi karaano ne bubalaayi chimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubeka lulala liliombakho elio lialoleelela abuundu aali busa chimita likhumi bubalaayi, aaba embi ne Lukaangu. Ne lubeka luluundi lialoleelela khu ndulo khwe luuya lwe enje. Yaba liliombakho lino liombakhwa mu ngila chitaru, buli ndala enyuma asi we kiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka we bunaswa we liliombakho lino, engila yabaao chimita chiraano bubalaayi, ne chimita kamakhumi karaano buleeyi, ne bilibwa lubeka lwene olu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisiro che chinju che khu ngaaki chaba chindiiti khukhila che akari nende asi. Sikila bachisendakho enyuma lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisiro chino choosi chaba chakana ne se chaba chetiila khu njeko chosi chosi nga chichaba khu luuya enje tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka lwe asi, lisiisi lie nje liaba lialolelaane ne chisiro lubeka lwe luuya enje. Buleeyi bwalio liaba chimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano ne nusu. Lubeka lwe enje khu ndulo, khwaba ne chisiro chichiindi mu mita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano buleeyi. Ne chichaba ne chachiloleelela lubeka luluundi chaba chimita kamakhumi karaano buleeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7+EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7",
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi we chinju chibili chino, elubeka we bukwe we liliombakho niio lisiisi lie luuya lwe enje lurakikhira, silibwa siabao siicha khu luuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka we siafubo sie Lukaangu, liliombakho liliindi liabaao lifwaanana, nende liili elubeka we mumbo we Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebweeni we chisiro chino, engila yabaayo bulayi bwene nga eeli lubeka lwe bunaswa. Chisiro chino chaba chakaniilila buleeyi ne bukhiikha, bilibwa khaloondekhasia khwa buli siindu nende kimiliango biaba bifwaanana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumuliango kwaba khu siro asi, lubeka lwe siafubo we liliombakho, elubeka lwe bukwe nga enju newa niio lisiisi liarakikhira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo aamboolela ali, “Chisiro che bunaswa nende che siafubo chichafutarira luuya chili chindakatifu, nimwo basaayi babeecha khusaaya Wele Omunyali owa Bioosi baliila biianwa bitakatifu lukali. Balaraamo biianwa bitakatifu lukali, biinwa bie bibiaamo, biianwa khulwe khurusiao bubwoni nende bie kumuruungo khulwe khurusiao bumayaanu, sikila abuundu ao ali atakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga basaayi ne bacha aali atakatifu ano, se balarura bache enje niio babaandu bali ne bakhafuulile chingubo nicho babeele nacho ne basaba tawe, sikila chino chili chindakatifu. Balafwara chichiindi ne bakhaacha embi ne babaandu tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sipiimo sie siwanja sie Lukaangu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga omundu oyo ne amala khupiima mukari mwe siwanja sie Lukaangu, aambila enje khubirira mu silibwa sie bukwe mala aapiima bukali bwe siwanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabukula luusia lulala mala aapiima lubeka lwe ebukwe, lwaba chimita chimia chibili ne kamakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aapiima lubeka lwe bunaswa, siafubo, nende mumbo, buli lubeka lwaba chimita chimia chibili ne kamakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17",
              "EZK.42.18",
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aapiima lisiisi liliabotookhelela, chimita chimia chibili ne kamakhumi karaano buli lubeka. Lisiisi elio liarumikhanga khukabukhania lubeka lutakatifu ne lubeka luukhali lutakatifu tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali owa Bioosi akobola mu Lukaangu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
